<item><title>Simão Mendes hospital workers press for 11 months of overdue allowances</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/simao-mendes-hospital-workers-press-for-11-months-of-bbffa9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/simao-mendes-hospital-workers-press-for-11-months-of-bbffa9/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>The hospital administrator says the government committed to pay three months, while staff also seek eight months of pay for contract workers.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:43:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" length="36788" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea-Bissau&apos;s military government delays elections until 2028</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-s-military-government-delays-elections-until-e426f6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-s-military-government-delays-elections-until-e426f6/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>The presidency says technical, material and financial conditions are insufficient for a credible vote, extending the transition beyond its promised year.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:13:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" length="36788" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea-Bissau delays presidential and parliamentary elections until 2028</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>Gen Horta N&apos;Tam&apos;s decree moves the polls from 6 December to 26 November 2028, extending the military-led transition beyond its promised 12 months.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:58:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/share.jpg" length="42577" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
